Production-ready authentication built on Better Auth with [Drizzle](/drizzle) ORM. Supports email/password, magic links, social providers (Google, GitHub), multi-factor authentication (MFA), and secure session management.

Read the [Authentication Overview](./authentication/overview) to get started.
